---
// /about → /artist.
//
// The page itself moved to src/pages/artist.astro; this file is only the
// forward. It exists because the site has been live on tartbyrj.pages.dev with
// /about in the nav, so inbound links, bookmarks and anything already indexed
// point here — none of that should hard-404 on a rename.
//
// Same Astro.redirect() pattern as works/[slug].astro and
// collections/[slug].astro. Those redirect on missing data; this one redirects
// unconditionally, which is the only difference. On a static build there is no
// server to issue a real 3xx, so Astro emits an HTML stub carrying
// <meta http-equiv="refresh"> — the status code below is what a future SSR or
// hybrid adapter would send, and is inert until then. The meta refresh IS the
// redirect on Cloudflare Pages today.
//
// 301, not 302: the move is permanent, and it is what tells crawlers to
// transfer /about's ranking to /artist rather than treating them as two pages.
//
// Nothing renders from here, so there is no <Layout> and no markup below.
return Astro.redirect('/artist', 301);
---
